## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical confidential computing design for multi-tenant workloads, addressing isolation, attestation, secure updates, and runtime monitoring.

## Key Concepts

- Confidential computing enclaves (SGX/SEV)
- Per-tenant key management with envelope encryption
- Remote attestation and policy enforcement
- Measured boot and secure updates
- Tamper-evident logging and anomaly detection

## Code Example

```javascript
// Attestation verification sketch
function verifyAttestation(report, publicKey, nonce) {
  const valid = verifySignature(report.signature, report.measurements, publicKey);
  if (!valid) throw new Error('Invalid attestation');
  if (report.nonce !== nonce) throw new Error('Nonce mismatch');
  return report.measurements === 'EXPECTED_MEASUREMENTS';
}
```

